1
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:56,720
Boss Wang,

2
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,240
why did you come alone?

3
00:00:58,760 --> 00:00:59,960
Where is my daughter?

4
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:01,920
Let Wu Mingyue go.

5
00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:07,490
I brought your aunt out for some fresh air.

6
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:09,980
She wants to see her daughter.

7
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,090
Where is Xuefei?

8
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:18,840
Uncle Li,

9
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:21,620
do you still remember who I am?

10
00:01:27,039 --> 00:01:28,800
Of course I know who you are.

11
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:30,840
You kid,

12
00:01:31,280 --> 00:01:32,600
you're really lucky.

13
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,960
Time and time again,

14
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:36,440
I just can't kill you.

15
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:37,600
Yeah.

16
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:40,759
The first time you tried to blow up my whole family, I was lucky.

17
00:01:40,759 --> 00:01:41,520
I didn't die.

18
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,330
The second time,

19
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:44,800
at the railway crossing,

20
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:45,860
I still didn't die.

21
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:47,640
Uncle Li,

22
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,770
I'm really tough to kill, aren't I?

23
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:54,400
Mom!

24
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,200
Li Zhijun,

25
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,840
give my mom back to me!

26
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:08,039
Girl,

27
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,690
is that how you talk to your dad?

28
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:14,920
Honey.

29
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,160
Look who's here.

30
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:19,680
Our daughter.

31
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,480
Our daughter.

32
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,560
Stay away from my mom.

33
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:26,400
My girl.

34
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,130
How long has it been since you saw your mom?

35
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:31,540
Didn't you always say you missed her?

36
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,360
Actually,

37
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:39,640
your mom didn't run off with anyone.

38
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,890
She's been by my side all along.

39
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,360
But,

40
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,620
she's not quite right in the head now.

41
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,240
If you don't believe me, try calling her.

42
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,500
See if she answers you.

43
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,079
Mom.

44
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,000
Mom.

45
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,600
I'm Xuefei.

46
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:01,560
Wife,

47
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,640
our daughter is calling you.

48
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:06,100
Don't touch my mom with your dirty hands.

49
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:14,410
What did you say?

50
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,560
You call these dirty hands?

51
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:27,480
Your dad raised you with these very hands,

52
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:29,840
through all the hardships.

53
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,600
And now you think they're dirty?

54
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,540
You don't deserve to be my dad.

55
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,240
For so many years,

56
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:40,360
I've dreamed of my mom every night,

57
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,480
dreaming of that New Year's Eve.

58
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,680
I always thought

59
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:46,440
I did something wrong as a daughter,

60
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:48,500
and that's why Mom didn't want me.

61
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,200
But you've been treating me like a fool.

62
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,320
You knew the truth all along.

63
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,800
Why didn't you tell me?

64
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,640
Don't you feel guilty seeing me like this?

65
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,840
As you grew up day by day,

66
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,930
I looked at your face every day,

67
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:07,720
asking myself

68
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:10,240
whose bastard you really are.

69
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:29,040
Li Zhijun, are you crazy?

70
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:30,840
Are you a psychopath?

71
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,480
Are you delusional?

72
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:34,040
I'm not your daughter?

73
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,170
Whose daughter am I?

74
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:36,400
Do you think

75
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:38,260
the whole world is betraying you?

76
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,840
What did I do wrong

77
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,960
to be deceived by you like a fool for over ten years?

78
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,520
What did my mom do wrong?

79
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:47,560
You locked her up like an animal for over ten years.

80
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:55,840
You are right.

81
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,560
You are right.

82
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,120
I am a psychopath.

83
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,850
I might also be delusional.

84
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:10,130
I now know that you are my daughter.

85
00:05:13,560 --> 00:05:15,490
Your mom never betrayed me either.

86
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:18,520
But I found out too late.

87
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,040
I'm sorry to you both.

88
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,720
I ruined our family with my own hands.

89
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,600
Not just your family.

90
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:32,540
Xiaolong's family

91
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,370
and Chen Nian's family,

92
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:36,200
all because of you.

93
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,120
Because of what you did,

94
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:41,120
I've felt guilty for sixteen years.

95
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,200
Why did you...

96
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:49,880
Li Zhijun,

97
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,840
you are surrounded.

98
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,420
Don't come any closer!

99
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:55,920
Put the knife down.

100
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:56,360
Get up.

101
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,240
Mom.

102
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,440
Mom.

103
00:05:58,760 --> 00:06:00,000
You are surrounded.

104
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:01,340
Put the knife down.

105
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,780
Put the knife down.

106
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,160
Okay.

107
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,610
You're all here, right?

108
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:11,480
You all want to know what's going on.

109
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:14,080
Then I'll tell you today.

110
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,400
Everything I did

111
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,570
was because of his parents,

112
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,880
Zhao Zhiguo and Wang Min.

113
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:23,800
Hello, Comrade Wang Min.

114
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,560
When we were kids,

115
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:28,650
I was never as good as Zhao Zhiguo at anything.

116
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,360
Even in business,

117
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:31,920
he was the boss

118
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,250
and I was the assistant.

119
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:36,250
Even the girl I liked only had eyes for him.

120
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,480
I thought

121
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,720
I'd go to a big city to try my luck.

122
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,440
Once I made a lot of money,

123
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:45,520
maybe Wang Min would finally look at me.

124
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,380
But when I came back with money...

125
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,890
Wang Min still wouldn't look me in the eye.

126
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,740
Is that Zhao Zhiguo

127
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:52,880
really that good?

128
00:06:53,760 --> 00:06:55,220
Later, I married Mingyue.

129
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,400
I opened my own factory.

130
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,000
I had a family too.

131
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:02,730
I thought everything was getting better.

132
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,160
But...

133
00:07:05,280 --> 00:07:07,610
I still couldn't compare to him in any way.

134
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,520
I worked so hard back then.

135
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:13,960
I finally got an order that could turn things around for me.

136
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:14,760
But in the end,

137
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,520
this order actually went to him,

138
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,720
Zhao Zhiguo.

139
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:18,800
Why?

140
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,080
I found out from a relative

141
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:24,280
that Zhao Zhiguo needed a gas cylinder.

142
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:25,040
I thought,

143
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,400
God was watching,

144
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,920
and finally gave me a great opportunity.

145
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:33,370
I absolutely couldn't miss it.

146
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:38,580
Just turning on the valve wasn't enough.

147
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,560
I wanted them dead.

148
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,890
The whole family had to die.

149
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,720
My plan was very successful.

150
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,450
It's just...

151
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:53,440
Mingyue.

152
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:54,520
Li Zhijun,

153
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,040
are you crazy?

154
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:58,840
Do you know you're committing murder?

155
00:07:59,200 --> 00:07:59,720
You...

156
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,480
I'm calling the police.

157
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:03,540
I'm calling the police to arrest you.

158
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:06,320
Li Zhijun!

159
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:07,760
Li Zhijun!

160
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,200
How is Zhao Zhiguo better than me?

161
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:16,440
Why do all the good things happen to him?

162
00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:17,400
You are a murderer.

163
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:19,130
Why are you playing the victim?

164
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:22,410
You keep saying everyone has wronged you,

165
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:24,440
but what about yourself?

166
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:27,000
Because of your own inferiority

167
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:27,860
and suspicion,

168
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:31,440
you made so many people suffer for 16 years.

169
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,130
Aren't you afraid of retribution?

170
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,450
I stopped being afraid a long time ago.

171
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:38,610
Retribution...

172
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,200
has already come.

173
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:48,680
Li Zhijun,

174
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,600
put the knife down.

175
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:52,640
Put the gun down.

176
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,640
Li Zhijun.

177
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,920
Did you kill Teng Xiaohu too?

178
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,560
I killed him.

179
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,040
Uncle Li.

180
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,640
Wang Hong is back.

181
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,560
Did you know?

182
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:03,680
I know.

183
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,640
What's wrong?

184
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:07,160
You knew Wang Hong is Zhao Long

185
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,240
before I did, right?

186
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:10,920
What?

187
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,240
Stop pretending.

188
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:15,440
Zhao Long

189
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:16,880
is the kid from Zhao Zhiguo's family

190
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,640
with heterochromia.

191
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:20,760
I know everything.

192
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:24,960
Xiaohu.

193
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:27,860
What nonsense are you talking about?

194
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:28,680
What Long?

195
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:31,240
Cut the crap.

196
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,320
Come with me now

197
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:34,360
to see him.

198
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:37,440
Tell him all the bad things you did back then.

199
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,560
This is your last chance.

200
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:43,170
Is that how you talk to Uncle Li?

201
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,920
You're getting all worked up.

202
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:47,380
Let's go. I'll go with you.

203
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:50,560
Uncle Li.

204
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:52,980
It's cold on the mountain.

205
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,880
Put on more clothes.

206
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,040
Okay.

207
00:10:01,800 --> 00:10:02,800
Wait for me.

208
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:05,530
I'll put on some thick clothes.

209
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,840
I'm done pretending.

210
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,880
This is your final warning.

211
00:10:58,640 --> 00:10:59,770
Don't be impulsive.

212
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:02,730
I'll put the knife down.

213
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:07,840
Li Xuefei.

214
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,840
This is retribution.

215
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,520
Your mom and I

216
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:15,020
are both like this now.

217
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:17,800
Being dead

218
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,970
is better than being alive.

219
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,960
Just pretend you don't have me as a father.

220
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:23,760
No.

221
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:24,720
Dad.

222
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,120
Mom.

223
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,700
Hurry, save the hostages.

224
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,560
My hometown

225
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:55,320
is hidden in a vast, deep forest.

226
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,680
The winter here is very long.

227
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,800
The snow can cover everything.

228
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,240
Under the snow,

229
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,840
it is still that black earth.

230
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,760
What should grow will grow.

231
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:08,720
The land remembers what should be remembered.

232
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,160
My mom said

233
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,320
wood has growth rings,

234
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:14,080
and people have them too,

235
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,360
carved in their hearts.

236
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,360
My stomach hurts.

237
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:18,160
They can't be erased.

238
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,400
It doesn't hurt.

239
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:22,260
How about here?

240
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:24,520
Okay.

241
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:25,520
It's nothing serious.

242
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:26,840
Okay, thank you, doctor.

243
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,720
I'll prescribe some medicine for you.

244
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,240
Okay.

245
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:52,720
Mom.

246
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,440
I'm taking you out for a walk.

247
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:06,960
Staying in the room all the time

248
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,040
makes you unhappy.

249
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:21,360
The factory recently received a new order.

250
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,240
It's quite big.

251
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:24,250
An order from the south.

252
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,280
The Lao Hongsong case

253
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:21,600
is solved.

254
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:25,560
The truth about the explosion at Zhao Zhiguo's house

255
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:26,820
has also come to light.

256
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,120
Do you know

257
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:33,140
who has been helping us all along?

258
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:35,760
It's Xiaolong.

259
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,000
He looks different

260
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:42,760
from when he was a kid.

261
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:46,040
He's still very thin.

262
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:46,570
Parents.

263
00:14:50,680 --> 00:14:51,920
Your police badge,

264
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:59,100
I've been wearing it all the time.

265
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:02,210
I didn't embarrass you.

266
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:06,460
The things in my heart,

267
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:11,320
Your son has always been guarding them.

268
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:37,680
Dad,

269
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,280
Mom,

270
00:15:40,040 --> 00:15:41,170
I've come to see you.

271
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:45,940
The person who harmed you has been found.

272
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:47,540
He is already dead.

273
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,520
But I don't feel much satisfaction.

274
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:58,920
I'm just tired.

275
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:03,760
Very tired.

276
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,980
When I was little, you always said

277
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:11,100
the sea was just beyond the woods.

278
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:14,100
But it was just one forest after another.

279
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,090
I still haven't seen it.

280
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,400
So I'm leaving.

281
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:26,040
I want to go to a warm place

282
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:29,600
and see the sea.

283
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:32,880
Don't worry.

284
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:37,450
I will take good care of myself.

285
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:41,370
I'll come see you again.

286
00:17:28,160 --> 00:17:30,160
Xue Ling asked me to give this to you.

287
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:33,400
Xuefei,

288
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:34,240
you...

289
00:17:37,320 --> 00:17:39,720
Save whatever you want to say for next time.

290
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,480
Brother Wang,

291
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,840
Seeing this letter is like seeing me.

292
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:46,280
Or maybe I should call you

293
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:47,320
Zhao Long.

294
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:49,820
We've kept this unspoken for so long.

295
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:51,970
It's time to bring it out into the open.

296
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:54,160
On New Year's Eve sixteen years ago,

297
00:17:54,320 --> 00:17:55,120
it was me

298
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:57,040
who cut off your family's power.

299
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:59,360
Now it's time to reap what I sowed.

300
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:00,520
I admit

301
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:01,720
to all of this.

302
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,680
Believe it or not,

303
00:18:04,280 --> 00:18:05,840
since the day you came back,

304
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:07,280
I've always

305
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:08,600
wanted to atone.

306
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,640
About Teng Xiaohu,

307
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:11,970
I went to see his father.

308
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,680
It wasn't to help you.

309
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,440
It was to help myself.

310
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:16,720
Doing a little bit

311
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:18,170
is better than nothing.

312
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:20,200
In this life,

313
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:21,800
I owe too much.

314
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:24,360
If I can make it up to you even a little,

315
00:18:24,360 --> 00:18:25,800
I can leave in peace.

316
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:27,440
I only hope you can

317
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,410
let go of everything in the past

318
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:31,170
and walk towards a better path.

319
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,400
Brother.
